                    <img alt="" data-fileid="787" src="https://zse.hr/UserDocsImages/logos/sgs/SGS-ISO-9001-white.png?vel=5791" style="width: 80px; height: 78px; margin-right: 3px"> &nbsp;
                </div>
                <div class="block-wrapper one-half">
                    <strong>Note:</strong>

<p>Trading data is displayed with 15 minutes delay.</p>

<p>For debt securities, the &quot;Quantity&quot; field represents the nominal amount.</p>

<p>Trading until December 31, 2022&nbsp;took place in HRK currency, and from January 1, 2023 in EUR currency. Data for statistical purposes before January 1, 2023&nbsp;is converted from the original currency HRK to the currency EUR using the&nbsp;fixed conversion rate 1&nbsp;EUR&nbsp;=&nbsp;7,53450&nbsp;HRK.</p>

                </div>
